exclusions:
  panel-datasource-rule:
    reason: >-
      Datasource UIDs are pinned on purpose (altinn-studio-metrics for the
      services' metrics, altinn-studio-traces for their traces), so the panels
      cannot bind to another datasource; see CLAUDE.md. The dashboard also mixes
      the two in one view, which a single template variable cannot express. The
      observability dashboard reads only the Victoria stack's own metrics, which
      only altinn-studio-metrics holds. The Designer dashboard reads Designer's spans
      through altinn-studio-traces-logsql and links them to altinn-studio-traces.
      The reports and alerts dashboard reads Designer's notification counters and
      lists failures from its spans the same way.
      The workflow engine dashboard reads only the engine's metrics.
      The operator dashboard reads the operator's metrics, and its failed runs from
      altinn-studio-traces and altinn-studio-traces-logsql.
      The gateway dashboard reads the gateway's metrics, lists its spans through
      altinn-studio-traces-logsql and links them to altinn-studio-traces, and
      shows its logs from altinn-studio-logs.
      The apps dashboard reads Designer's and the operator's app metrics.
    entries:
      - dashboard: "Altinn Studio — PDF3"
      - dashboard: "Altinn Studio — Observability"
      - dashboard: "Altinn Studio — Designer"
      - dashboard: "Altinn Studio - Workflow Engine"
      - dashboard: "Altinn Studio — Reports and alerts"
      - dashboard: "Altinn Studio — Operator"
      - dashboard: "Altinn Studio — Gateway"
      - dashboard: "Altinn Studio — Apps"
  template-datasource-rule:
    reason: >-
      No datasource template variable by design; see panel-datasource-rule.
    entries:
      - dashboard: "Altinn Studio — PDF3"
      - dashboard: "Altinn Studio — Observability"
      - dashboard: "Altinn Studio — Designer"
      - dashboard: "Altinn Studio - Workflow Engine"
      - dashboard: "Altinn Studio — Reports and alerts"
      - dashboard: "Altinn Studio — Operator"
      - dashboard: "Altinn Studio — Gateway"
      - dashboard: "Altinn Studio — Apps"
